 "description": "<p>Three functions share one body here: a rose head that sucks, a bullet that vibrates, and a thrusting motion that turns the insertable end into an active player instead of a passive one. Ten sucking-vibration modes drive the rose head, while the bullet below thrusts on its own — aimed at the G-spot, or used anally as a small thrusting plug.</p>\n<p>The rose head works the way the shape always does: rotating airflow pulls and releases around the clitoris in patterns that build fast. Because the bullet moves on its own, your hands stay free to steer pressure and angle instead of doing the work.</p>\n<p>Either end can lead. Foreplay tends to start with the rose and finish with the bullet, but the reverse order has its fans — the toy does not care about the sequence, only that both motors get their turn.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Functions: clitoral sucking + vibration + active thrusting (3-in-1)</li>\n<li>Modes: 10 sucking-vibration patterns</li>\n<li>Material: medical-grade silicone, body-safe and odorless</li>\n<li>Volume: quiet, low-decibel motor</li>\n<li>Waterproof: yes, usable in bathroom and pool</li>\n</ul>\n<p>One purchase, three sensations — the honest pitch for anyone deciding between a sucker and a thruster.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>3-in-1 rose toy combining 10-mode clitoral sucking, vibration and an actively thrusting G-spot bullet, all in medical-grade silicone.</p>\n",
